WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:02.530
Chara-su!

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:05.620
Is everyone shugo-peppy today?

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.280
Today we'll be dancing for you!

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.710
Let's start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.230
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:13.520
Unlock!

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.120
My heart: Unlock!

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.350
Open up my heart!

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.490
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:33.920
We're going on forever!

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:38.190
There's nothing to fear!

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:45.300
Lately it feels like things have changed a bit...

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:51.500
And it's, well, kind of nice, you know?

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.690
Doesn't matter who you are, if you don't give up,

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:59.140
you'll fly farther than you did today.

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:02.840
Even if you cry a bunch, and get depressed,

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.660
the morning will still come! So!

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.910
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:12.800
You'll find the courage!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.050
Hold your head high, going on!

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.780
Continue on to tomorrow!

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:22.970
Your heart: Unlock!

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.850
Open up your heart!

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:30.020
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.580
We're going on forever!

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:37.660
There's nothing to fear!

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:49.550
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:52.710
"Shugo Chara Love Theater"

00:01:53.990 --> 00:01:57.550
Hey, Shugo Chara Shopping is starting!

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:58.800
Okay!

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:02.610
I wonder what they'll
be selling today?

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:04.010
Switch on!

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:10.430
Shugo Chara Love Theater?

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:18.820
Oh, Pepe! Why dost thou
not return my love?

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:20.800
Forgive me, Kiseki!

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:24.030
That is not what I
wanted to hear!

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:25.420
What's this?

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:28.150
Maybe Shugo Chara Shopping
got canceled?

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:30.480
But this seems entertaining.

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:36.170
I swear my unchanging love
for you on this rod!

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:39.480
Yes, this rod everyone
knows and loves!

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:43.550
And this decoration on the
tip has special functions!

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:48.230
Whether it's dusting
high places...

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.160
Or cleaning in a dark room...

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:52.860
You can see perfectly, and
make everything clean!

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:56.730
It's no different than my love!
It will remain unchanged for eternity!

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:58.580
And right now this
rod is only...

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:00.320
Three, nine, eight!

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:03.860
Ah, so it really was Shugo Chara Shopping.

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:05.530
Wait just a second-nya!

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:07.680
Pepe is mine-nya!

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:10.770
What? Then, let's fight!

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:13.350
I'll never let you have her-nya.

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:15.580
Now be felled by
this scythe-nya!

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:18.650
Yes, this scythe everyone
knows and loves!

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:22.180
With just one swing,
and the grass is trimmed!

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:25.070
One swipe, and it's done!

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:28.310
It's so sharp it'll cut off that last
remaining bit of affection-nya!

00:03:28.550 --> 00:03:30.230
And right now this
scythe is only...

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:32.250
Three, nine, eight!

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.610
So, which one will you choose?

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:35.360
Choose-nya!

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.750
I can't choose between you...

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:40.620
And so for you indecisive
people out there...

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:41.830
If you buy this rod...

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:42.740
And this scythe...

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:49.720
...at the same time, Shugo Chara shopping will
send them to you for only four, nine, eight!

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:52.830
Call now!

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:55.680
So it's television shopping
with a drama mixed in.

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.850
They sure do think
of everything.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:00.190
I think it needs some work.

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:01.210
Yeah, that's right!

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:03.130
Why is Pepe the heroine?

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:05.720
Why does she get both
the guys? It ain't fair!

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.180
So that's...

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.470
...what she's upset about...

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:11.030
Shugo Chara Shopping!

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.930
See you again!

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:16.680
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia, Character Transformations!

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:18.790
The first one we'll
introduce is...

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:21.110
Clown Drop!

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:28.870
Clown Drop is the form that Rima takes when
she Character Transforms with Kusukusu.

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:34.210
Her special attacks are manipulating
juggling clubs using Juggling Party,

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:38.080
and attacking her opponents using
a rope with Tightrope Dancer!

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:43.610
That one piece clown outfit and the
big red ribbon are really cute!

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:50.340
The second transformation is...

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:53.560
Sky Jack!

00:04:55.300 --> 00:05:00.000
Sky Jack is the form that Kukai takes when
he Character Transforms with Daichi!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:07.350
His special attack is hitting the enemy with a
soccer ball of energy, Golden Victory Shoot!

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:12.460
He can also chase X eggs
with his skateboard.

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:18.610
We'll continue these Shugo Character
Encyclopedia's each week!

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:21.210
Look forward to it!

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:32.220
We've finished our dance for our Shugo Chara Dokki
Doki theme song, "Thank You, I'm So Grateful!"

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:41.320
The dance for Shugo Chara Dokki Doki's theme
song "Thank You, I'm So Grateful" is finished!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:47.060
We want everyone to remember it too, so starting next
episode we'll be splitting it up into 4 lessons for you!

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:50.740
If you remember all of them, you
can dance the whole thing!

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:54.760
This time, let's watch the Eggs dance the
whole thing for us as an example!

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:59.830
Can you show everyone how the dance goes?

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:00.830
Sure!

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:03.660
Then, go and show everyone!

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:05.180
Watch us!

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:14.320
kinou to wa chigau jibun ni

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:07.670
Lesson 1!

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:21.760
kitto nareru yo hoppu suteppu de janpu

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:25.820
(instrumental break)

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:31.660
kimi to deaeta kara mainichi wakuwaku nan da

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.150
Lesson 2!

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:36.290
subettari korondari sore mo tanoshii

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:41.850
sou ieba ima made chanto

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:38.330
Lesson 3!

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:51.640
ienakatta kotoba ga arun da

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:56.270
arigatou zenbu ni kansha!

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:54.390
Lesson 4!

00:06:56.270 --> 00:07:05.180
sunao ni ieru sore mo kimi no okage ka na

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:10.640
(instrumental end)

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:15.700
That's a really cool dance
you finished!

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:20.430
So starting next, we'll being the
Shugo-shugo Dance Lessons!

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:23.340
Watch each of the four segments, and
memorize them along with the Eggs!

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:24.810
Look forward to it!

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:34.470
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.820
"After A Round of
Ghost Stories"

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:45.510
Because the woman who held the grudge
was actually a ghost herself!

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:52.110
Nothing happened.

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:58.210
They say that something strange happens if you finish telling
a round of ghost stories, but nothing happened.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:00.990
I wish a youkai or two
would have appeared.

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:04.620
If a youkai shows up,
I'll beat 'im like "hiya!"

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:12.700
What's the matter, Ran?

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:15.090
This is the Japanese monster,
the youkai Mutou!

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:22.260
Ran has been taken over by the Mutou and "dadashiko"
is like the sound of a youkai taiko drum!

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:24.800
I don't understand,
but this can't be good!

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:27.690
What should we do? Is this because
we told those ghost stories?

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.920
Ack! Now it's got Su!

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:40.750
That's the sound of demons returning to a Jizou shrine
after they were called out by ancient tales!

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.350
What should we do, Dia?!

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:50.450
Please, God! I'll never tell
ghost stories again!

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:57.890
This is the mysterious voice of the youkai
said to have appeared in Furukawa City!

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:12.210
What am I to do?

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:17.110
I have finally been taken
over by the youkai!

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:25.540
Dadashikodadashikodadashikodadashiko
dadashikodadashikodadashikodadashiko

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:29.530
Tegujigubagujiguhyourororo,
tegujigubagujiguhyourororo

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:33.620
Ougisoyosoyodondondon,
ougisoyosoyodondondon

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:37.740
Dadashikodadashikodadashikodadashiko

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:37.740
Tegujigubagujigutegujigubagujigutegujigubagujigu

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:37.740
Kikkurimokkurikikkurimokkuri

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:39.600
Ougisoyosoyo dondondon

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.600
Tegujigubagujiguhyourororo

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:42.770
Dadashikodadashiko

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:43.660
Bareroun

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:47.620
Dadashikodadashikodadashikodadashiko
dadashikodadashikodadashikodadashiko

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:47.620
Tegujigubagujiguhyourororo,
tegujigubagujiguhyourororo

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:47.620
Kikkurimokkuriginzarakaino,
yussurimokkuriwaiwaiwai

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:48.730
Dadashikodadashiko

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:49.720
Tegujigubagujigu

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:50.890
Ougisoyosoyo

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:51.690
Bareroun

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:54.920
Dadashikodadashikodadashiko
dadashikodadashikodadashiko

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:54.920
Tegujigubagujigutegujigubagujigu

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:54.920
Ougisoyosoyo

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:56.370
Bareroun!

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:57.730
See you again!

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:01.820
Coming up next is Shugo
Chara Dokki Doki!

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:05.240
Today's episode is:
"How do you do? My name is Hotaru."

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:08.340
It starts right after the end
of last week's episode.

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:11.190
We'll be getting a lot of introductions today, I'm sure!

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:12.610
I can't wait!

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:14.040
Yeah!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:28.140
I'm sure I can be a different person than I was yesterday

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:32.970
with a hop, step, and a jump!

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:42.820
Since I met you I've been in a tizzy every day.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:48.350
Laughing, getting angry, going crazy... It's been tough!

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:53.650
Since I was able to see you, I've been excited every day.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:58.500
Even slipping and falling, I've been having fun!

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:06.480
Now that I think about it, I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:12.290
I have something to say.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:18.230
Thank you, I'm so grateful!

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:24.580
I might not be saying it right, but it comes from my heart.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:29.090
Thank you, for everything!

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:36.660
It's all thanks to you that I can be honest and say it.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:50.010
Senpai, Senpai... Amu-senpai!

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:56.480
Amu-senpai-senpai!

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:59.630
It hatched!

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:04.640
Seriously, what's with you?

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:06.680
It hatched!

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:08.020
What did?

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:12.090
Your Guardian Character hatched!

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:13.520
That is great!

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:15.380
Congratulations, Rikka-chan.

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:19.760
21 - How do you do?
My name is Hotaru.

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:21.170
How do you do, Amu-san? I have heard
much about you from Rikka.

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:27.890
I do hope you and I, as well as Rikka,
will get along splendidly henceforth.

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:29.300
Uh... Right!

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:33.130
But of course I am
at your service...

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:35.640
No way...

00:12:35.640 --> 00:12:37.350
Way!

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:38.610
Seriously?

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:44.650
Wha?! She's Rikka-chan's
Guardian Character?

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:52.110
As Rikka's elder I intend to one day rule
the Guardians! I am Yaya-chan!

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:54.410
And her Guardian Character
Pepe-tan-dechu!

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:58.100
How do you do, Yaya-chan-san,
Pepe-tan-san?

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:02.230
I do hope you and I, as well
as Rikka, will get along.

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:04.030
Oh, well...

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:06.760
I, too, am at your service...

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:10.390
You are really calm.

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.890
Are you really Rikka-tan's
Guardian Character?

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:14.270
Yes, that is right.

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:16.340
What's that-dechu?

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:20.400
A secret.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:22.190
A secret?

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.920
Now I'm curious-dechu...

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:28.590
Anyway, you're all warm and
snuggly, Hotaru-chan.

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:32.790
She's actually warm for real!

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:36.860
You're right!

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:39.430
Warm and comfy...

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:45.830
It looks like Hotaru-chan is a
calm and dependable girl.

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:46.380
Yeah...

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:49.940
So that's who Rikka
wants to be, huh?

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:52.550
Rikka seems really happy.

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:56.450
Is it really such a good thing to have
a Guardian Character be born?

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:58.760
It's not that it's good or bad.

00:13:58.760 --> 00:14:02.400
It's because Rikka-chan has been
waiting so long for it to hatch.

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:05.180
Yeah, I know that.

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:12.650
I want to introduce you to the rice fish
and the rabbits and the chicks, and more!

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:13.700
Sure!

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:16.140
Let me go and greet everyone!

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:16.850
Okay.

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:20.390
I see.

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:25.050
This is an occasion where one
should say "Congratulations."

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:30.150
Me?!

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:31.290
Right.

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:36.990
Now that you are an actual Character Bearer, I think you
should become a full-fledged Guardian next year.

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:41.980
The next General Guardian's Assembly
will be like practice for that.

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:46.380
I'll be the MC, and Hikaru-chi'll
be my assistant.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:50.300
And Rikka-tan'll announce the
results of the survey, got it?

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:57.830
A-A-Announcing means standing up on the stage in the
assembly hall in front of all the students, right?

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:58.500
Right.

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:03.590
Ahh! What'll I do? I might screw up!
No, I'll definitely screw up!

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:06.310
Of course I'm gonna
screw it up!

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:08.930
Yeah. You will surely
screw it up.

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:11.010
Shaddap, you!

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:12.510
Okay, start the rehearsal!

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:24.760
Th-Th-Th-These are the r-r-results of the
s-s-serby, I mean, s-s-survey,

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:30.820
that w-we c-c-c-conducted l-l-last m-m-m-onth
about u-u-unitards, I mean, u-u-u-uniforms...

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:31.760
I can't do it!

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:33.820
Somebody help me!

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.820
You'll be fine, Rikka-chan.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:40.950
Gentle, Warm, Character Change!

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:53.430
I will now announce the results of the survey that was
conducted last month regarding school uniforms.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:59.250
Wow! I've never seen you
so calm, Rikka-tan!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:01.370
Amazing-dechu!

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.040
That's the first time
for me, too!

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:06.070
Thank you, Hotaru!

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:11.090
Looks like she'll be fine as
long as she has Hotaru.

00:16:11.090 --> 00:16:12.040
Yeah.

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:18.870
A few days later.

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:23.490
We will now begin the General
Guardian's Assembly.

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:29.700
I will be presiding over
the assembly!

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:32.540
I'm the Ace's Chair,
Yuiki Yaya!

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:34.170
Thanks!

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:37.930
That's quite the friendly greeting.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.850
It's good that she's being herself.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:45.850
First thing, we'll announce the
results of the uniform survey!

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.920
It's my turn!

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:49.230
You can do it.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.230
Right!

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:03.780
Everybody's looking...

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:20.340
Everybody's looking at
me... I can't move...

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:22.150
Rikka...

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:25.990
Hotaru? What are you doing?

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:28.000
Why are you here?

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.950
Rikka-chan's in trouble!

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:31.530
She'll be fine.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:32.950
Calm down, everyone.

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:35.780
You're <i>too</i> calm, Hotaru-chan!

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:42.050
The overall results,
if you please...

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:43.330
Right!

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:51.710
I can't watch!

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:53.850
Wait, Amu-chan...

00:17:53.850 --> 00:17:54.840
Tadase-kun...

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:58.550
But...

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:05.440
Everybody's looking...

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:08.440
Everybody's looking...

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:19.450
I can't... I can't speak...

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.930
I just...

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:28.900
You'll be fine, Rikka-chan.

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:32.460
Hotaru!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:35.690
Why didn't you come earlier?

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:39.460
Then I wouldn't have tripped
and screwed up!

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:41.430
Isn't it good that
you screwed up?

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:45.310
Screwing up, doing
it correctly...

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:48.310
Both of those are important experiences
for you to have, Rikka-chan.

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:50.650
It would be a shame to
be frightened of them.

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:54.090
You should screw up
again and again!

00:18:54.090 --> 00:18:56.390
By correcting those mistakes again
and again, you will improve.

00:18:56.390 --> 00:19:00.860
And then they will all become precious
treasures to you, Rikka-chan!

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:05.080
Screwups are... treasures?

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:11.900
If you ask me to help you, we can
Character Change any time.

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:17.550
Because I will always be by your side...
Always looking out for you.

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:19.050
Really?

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:20.490
Yeah!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:33.820
Hotaru told me that it's
okay to screw up.

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:35.810
It's okay to screw up!

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:47.740
I'll announce the overall results of the survey
that was conducted last month!

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:55.550
First, please have a look at the
handout we passed out.

00:19:55.550 --> 00:20:00.590
On the first page are the results
for the entire student body.

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:05.860
Then below it on the right and left are the
results for boys and girls respectively.

00:20:05.860 --> 00:20:10.270
This asked you whether you were
satisfied overall with...

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.290
It's over, with no
major problems.

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:15.170
I was so worried there!

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:17.630
Me, too...

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:19.810
But your presentation
went well.

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:23.450
You didn't even have to Character
Change, Rikka!

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.690
Thank you very much!

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:30.150
I'm going to go take care
of the flower beds.

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:35.170
Hotaru isn't just
calming, is she.

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:39.560
Hey, Rikka!

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:40.820
What is it?

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:42.620
Here.

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:47.260
What is this?

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:48.640
Congratulations.

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:56.690
I learned in the past that gifts are
things people give from the heart.

00:20:57.970 --> 00:21:01.720
I really wish to congratulate you on your
Guardian Character being born.

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:06.280
Thank you!

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:12.180
Wow, it's sparkling
and way beautiful!

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:13.700
I'll treasure it!

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:17.130
That sure is nice.

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:20.510
Hey, let's show it to the
birds and the bunnies!

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:21.270
Sure!

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:27.560
I am glad the present
is unharmed.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:28.640
Yeah!

00:21:29.190 --> 00:21:31.550
Thanks!

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:37.720
Looks like Rikka and Hotaru will
make a good combination.

00:21:37.720 --> 00:21:38.600
Yeah!

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:47.740
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.680
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:56.090
Which egg will be
the lucky one?

00:21:59.720 --> 00:22:01.820
Guardian Egg Studying Fortune!

00:22:01.820 --> 00:22:04.250
First, for those of you who
chose Ran's egg...

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:07.370
Four Shugoluck stars!
Super lucky!

00:22:07.370 --> 00:22:09.400
You'll receive a flash
of inspiration!

00:22:09.400 --> 00:22:12.650
If you have a test, you might
get a high score!

00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:15.430
Miki's egg is three
Shugoluck stars.

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:18.050
Get advice from someone
older than you.

00:22:18.050 --> 00:22:19.740
Su's egg is two Shugoluck stars.

00:22:19.740 --> 00:22:22.330
Make sure to double-check
your homework!

00:22:19.740 --> 00:22:22.940
You might have made a big mistake!

00:22:23.300 --> 00:22:25.720
Finally, for those of you
who chose Dia's egg...

00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:29.250
Aw, snap! One Shugoluck star!

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:32.770
You can't get motivated, and your
homework might pile up!

00:22:32.770 --> 00:22:35.730
If you get in that situation, eat
some chocolate to power up!

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:36.790
Good luck!

00:22:39.180 --> 00:22:41.100
We sure had fun today!

00:22:41.100 --> 00:22:43.680
See you next time on
Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:43.680 --> 00:22:47.150
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:47.150 --> 00:22:48.640
Bye-bye!

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:20.040
Now's the time to make your move.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:24.690
Nothing will start if you start worrying.

00:23:24.690 --> 00:23:27.110
A song to your lips!

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:30.830
Yeah! What're you waiting for?

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:33.610
Bang on this door to the world.

00:23:33.610 --> 00:23:37.490
On whose terms?  That's right, ours!

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:43.020
Just trying to grasp success before you,

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:48.590
you're sure to become lost in the labyrinth.

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:55.670
Embrace the melody in your heart!

00:23:55.670 --> 00:24:00.830
Try singing it, try shouting it!

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:11.640
Each time you get closer to who you
want to be, they'll be given birth:

00:24:11.640 --> 00:24:14.260
Our Songs!
